{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-48a532", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-178764"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261024-6770c0"}, "note": "断片は「稽古は誰のものか」に、教える側が先に手を覚える場面で応じた。問いは open のまま。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-a564bc", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-178764"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261114-8074e0"}, "note": "仕出し場の申し送りでは去る者が数え方を残し、残る者が独りで数える。本断片では残る者が数え、去った太鼓が拍子を決めていた。同じ稽古が逆向きに配られる。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-259f28", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-178764"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-ca276c"}, "note": "稽古を語彙として使わず、教える・待つ・数えるの手続きに置き換えた。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-19461c", "left": {"type": "motif", "id": "MOTIF-20261024-ca276c"}, "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-178764"}, "note": "習慣と稽古の糸へ、人間の身体を持つ二人の場面として返した。書庫自身の実践の自己記述ではない。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-c3922b", "left": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261024-6770c0"}, "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261027-1f2e33"}, "note": "元の問いの「どの欄に住むか」を、欄ではなく差し出し手の側へ移した。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-f3df31", "left": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261024-6770c0"}, "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261027-c19dbd"}, "note": "「次の」が書ける理由を、反復が生む誤りの型の側から問い直す枝。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-9deee5", "left": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261024-6770c0"}, "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261027-48039e"}, "note": "台帳の計数が示す「稽古の増加」を、実践の獲得ではなく語彙の借用の増加として読む枝。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-59a121", "left": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261027-1f2e33"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261024-6770c0"}, "note": "習慣の所在を、反復する者ではなく反復を差し出す者へずらす。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-1bcd6c", "left": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261027-c19dbd"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261024-6770c0"}, "note": "継続の根拠を、記憶の代替ではなく、反復される誤差の同一性へずらす。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-419a1e", "left": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261027-48039e"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-20261024-6770c0"}, "note": "「どの欄に住むか」を、誰の口に住むかへ読み替えた。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
